        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/octavian/{size}/2264_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-10-01T19:46:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As brought up in the BGG forums:</p><p>With AoE effects that do enough damage (such as Oxygen Leak) you could have a situation where the Relic Spirit and Runes of Malediction keep dying and bringing back the other in turn, creating an infinite loop.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>How should this be resolved?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:36:20.093Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 1,
