      {
        "id": 39606,
        "name": "dypaca",
        "username": "dypaca",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dypaca/{size}/2079_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-10-02T00:57:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Given that the normal method of avoiding loops&nbsp;has been&nbsp;putting a \"the first time\" restriction, I'm tempted to just say that Runes of Malediction should be errataed to say \"The first time each turn Runes of Malediction is destroyed\".&nbsp; It would be nice to have a general rule on breaking loops though.</p>",
