        "raw": "<p>Given that the normal method of avoiding loops&nbsp;has been&nbsp;putting a &quot;the first time&quot; restriction, I&#39;m tempted to just say that Runes of Malediction should be errataed to say &quot;The first time each turn Runes of Malediction is destroyed&quot;.&nbsp; It would be nice to have a general rule on breaking loops though.</p>",
