        "created_at": "2012-10-07T18:20:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well, this certainly seems like an issue.&nbsp; I have no good way around it.&nbsp; Perhaps we can hope for an official response on this one.&nbsp; This is the only infinite loop I've seen so far, if that's any consolation.&nbsp; (I think.)</p>",
