        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Nah, there&#39;s another one I know of. &nbsp;Experimental Mutagen and a sufficiently buff-ed Expatriette with Hair-Trigger Reflexes. &nbsp;The Rat comes in, gets killed, goes back to the discard, and Experimental Mutagen continues bringing rats from the discard. &nbsp;As stated above, the &quot;first time&quot; or &quot;once&quot; solution has usually been suggested to solve this (i.e. Experimental Mutagen brings all rats back &quot;once&quot;).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Before it was an oddity, but when you combine this particular loop with Akash&#39;bhuta.....*shudder*.</p>",
